This is a great requirement. It transforms your system from a "Single File Processor" into a "Batch Processor".
Here is the exact logic we will implement:
 * Input: User sends ID: 101.
 * Lookup: System gets Config 101 -> REPORT_ID = "nwsa_report".
 * Smart Filter: It splits "nwsa_report" -> extracts "nwsa".
 * Discovery: It goes to your Input Folder, scans all files, and finds everyone containing "nwsa" in the name (e.g., nwsa_data_001.psv, nwsa_data_25000.psv).
 * Queuing: It instantly pushes 25,000 jobs to the internal queue.
 * Processing: The background threads chew through them one by one.
Here is the updated, production-ready code.
